Subject: Widen GitLab 18 gem pins for published fixes

GitLab 18.11 Gemfile pins keep rubyzip below 3.4, mail at 2.9.0, and sidekiq-cron below 2.4. The omnibus-only license_finder group also caps rubyzip below 3 and is not installed in this image, so that group is removed and the sidekiq-cron poller guard moves to 2.4.0.

Origin: DHI-internal (gem constraint remediation)
Description: Raise rubyzip to 3.4, mail to 2.9.1, and sidekiq-cron to 2.4 in the GitLab 18 Gemfile, remove the omnibus-only license_finder group, and move the sidekiq-cron poller guard to 2.4.0.
CVE: CVE-2025-67202
CVE: CVE-2026-63435
CVE: CVE-2026-85396
Base-Tree: git https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-foss.git 88b58ca2ef291340a001fff50d1a79a80fa50f36
Verify: cmd `grep Sidekiq::Cron::VERSION lib/gitlab/patch/sidekiq_cron_poller.rb` expect "2.4.0"
Forwarded: not-needed (Gemfile floors and the sidekiq-cron guard are packaging pins for this image)
Drop-When: never: GitLab 18.11 still pins rubyzip below 3.4, mail at 2.9.0, and sidekiq-cron below 2.4

